  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Review 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e: the item's JS repro (package.json-declared llmkit) now reports 'untraced dependency: llmkit' with untraced_modules third_party=[llmkit], via WI-juzaj's manifest stamp (9b3ee5db28, ir.py:2245). Still true: only python.yaml has stdlib_modules; with no manifest, require('worker_threads') and require('llmkit') both land in 'unknown' ('standard library is not enumerated'). Remaining scope is stdlib/runtime modules and manifest-unresolved deps; the elixir/js half overlaps WI-hotut. MECHANISM: catalogue lacks stdlib enumeration so ADR-0041 s3 predicate cannot tell stdlib from third_party. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-hotut,WI-hajag,WI-tikar."  # 3d7c
